    <desc>Choose the shape of the cursor and whether it blinks.</desc>
  </info>

  <title>Change cursor</title>

<steps>
<item><p>Press the menu button in the top-right corner of the window and select <gui style="menuitem">Preferences</gui>.</p></item><item><p>In the <gui>Profiles</gui> group, click the profile you want to change. Its settings open on a page of their own.</p></item>
<item><p>In the <gui>Cursor</gui> group, choose a <gui>Shape</gui>: <gui>Block</gui> (█), <gui>I-Beam</gui> (▏) or <gui>Underline</gui> (▁).</p></item>
<item><p>Set <gui>Blinking</gui> to follow the system setting, or to always or never blink.</p></item>
</steps>

  <p>The colors of the cursor can be changed with <gui>Override Cursor
  Color</gui> in the <link xref="app-colors#custom">colors</link> of the
  profile.</p>

